    {
      "id": "qpg34ilv8",
      "node_id": "node-accept-health-profile-30631b79",
      "version_tag": "v1",
      "title": "Accept Health Profile",
      "description": {
        "text": {
          "text": {
            "text": {
              "text": {
                "text": {
                  "text": {
                    "text": {
                      "text": {
                        "text": "Converts health insurance eligibility inputs into a pipe‑delimited profile string with boolean normalization.\n\nThis node maps raw user inputs from a health insurance eligibility screen into a standardized pipe‑separated string. It takes nine parameters: age, marital status, family planning intention, chronic condition presence, travel frequency, minimum sum insured, and three boolean preferences (maternity, OPD, and wellness coverage). The node converts the boolean‑like strings (“true”/“false”) into actual Python booleans, with smart defaults: if the maternity preference is not explicitly provided, it defaults to the family planning intention; OPD and wellness default to false. It then assembles a consistent string following the format Age: <value> | MaritalStatus: <value> | .... This clean, parseable output enables downstream nodes to reliably extract user attributes for policy filtering and scoring.",
                        "lineHeight": 14,
                        "fontSize": 11,
                        "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                      },
                      "lineHeight": 14,
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                    },
                    "lineHeight": 14,
                    "fontSize": 11,
                    "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                  },
                  "lineHeight": 14,
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                },
                "lineHeight": 14,
                "fontSize": 11,
                "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
              },
              "lineHeight": 14,
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
            },
            "lineHeight": 14,
