    {
      "id": "g5szeuuv1",
      "node_id": "node-accept-health-lifestyle-15cba6c6",
      "version_tag": "v1",
      "title": "Accept Health Lifestyle",
      "description": {
        "text": {
          "text": {
            "text": {
              "text": {
                "text": {
                  "text": {
                    "text": {
                      "text": {
                        "text": "Normalizes user lifestyle and importance ratings for health insurance criteria into a pipe‑delimited string.\n\nThis node transforms user preferences from a second health insurance screen into a standardized lifestyle string. It accepts eight inputs: room preference, city tier, smoking status, annual budget, existing policy, and importance ratings (low/medium/high) for seven criteria: chronic coverage, senior‑friendliness, maternity, cashless convenience, preventive benefits, claim approval rate, and hospital network size. The node concatenates these values into a pipe‑separated format with labels like RoomPref, Zone, Smoker, Budget, ExistingPolicy, and importance fields (ImpChronic, ImpSenior, etc.). This structured output allows downstream recommendation engines to incorporate the user’s stated priorities — for example, giving extra weight to chronic coverage if rated “high” — and to tailor final recommendations accordingly.",
                        "lineHeight": 14,
                        "fontSize": 11,
                        "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                      },
                      "lineHeight": 14,
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                    },
                    "lineHeight": 14,
                    "fontSize": 11,
                    "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                  },
                  "lineHeight": 14,
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                },
                "lineHeight": 14,
                "fontSize": 11,
