    {
      "id": "v7k07apzd",
      "node_id": "node-health-insurance-recommendation-3ae5d900",
      "version_tag": "v1",
      "title": "Health Insurance Recommendation",
      "description": {
        "text": {
          "text": {
            "text": {
              "text": {
                "text": {
                  "text": {
                    "text": {
                      "text": {
                        "text": "Retrieves full policy wordings for top 3 shortlisted plans and builds a detailed final recommendation prompt.\n\nThis node prepares a comprehensive prompt for an LLM to produce the single best health insurance recommendation from a shortlist. It first parses the shortlisted policies (from the previous LLM output) to extract the names of the top three plans. For each of these, it queries the insurance vector database to retrieve detailed policy wordings, benefits, and exclusions (up to 15 chunks per policy), and concatenates them into a rich context block. The node then builds an elaborate prompt that includes the full user profile, lifestyle preferences, the shortlisted plans, the retrieved policy documents, and the scorecard data (rubrics and weights). The LLM is instructed to re‑evaluate eligibility, compute weighted scores using profile‑adaptive weights, consider the user’s expressed importance ratings, and perform a comparative analysis of the three plans. It must then select the best plan, justify with three data‑backed reasons, highlight trade‑offs, and suggest an alternative. The output follows a strict format (BEST_PLAN, WHY THIS PLAN, TRADE-OFFS, ALTERNATIVE) with no extra text, ensuring a clear, actionable recommendation.",
                        "lineHeight": 14,
                        "fontSize": 11,
                        "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                      },
                      "lineHeight": 14,
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                    },
                    "lineHeight": 14,
                    "fontSize": 11,
                    "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                  },
                  "lineHeight": 14,
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                },
                "lineHeight": 14,
                "fontSize": 11,
                "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
              },
              "lineHeight": 14,
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
            },
            "lineHeight": 14,
            "fontSize": 11,
            "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
          },
          "lineHeight": 14,
